      "content": "i know, i'll talk to them eventually but they're so hard to get an appointment with and everything is so expensive. i just want to try something tonight. like what's a normal amount for a person with my condition? can i just take like a heavy dose like 400mg or 500mg to make sure it works? i just need some sleep.",
